{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1ad7555-f268-8bbc-bf4b-48032edd24dd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T11:48:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis N. Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:46:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good morning, Beth. Yeah, hi, this is Luis Herrera. I'm calling, you know, about a swing at one of the playgrounds. It's broken, I mean, really broken. Right, you follow me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Which playground are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:46:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one at the beach park, the little one by the sand, past the parking lot. I was walking over there yesterday, nice and cold but sunny, and, you know, one of the swings is hanging by just one chain. The seat's down on the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, okay. One chain, seat on the ground. Could that have come from the wind, with the storm that came through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be, could be. The coastal storm Friday and Saturday, that was three days ago, right? It blew hard down there. I mean, I don't know if it broke then or somebody yanked on it, but, you know, kids will climb on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll get that reported so it gets taped off or taken down until it's fixed. Is it the only swing affected, or are others loose too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the one. The other two looked okay. I didn't, um, shake them or anything. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you did plenty. Let me put it in. [pause] Okay, I've got it logged as a broken swing at the beach park playground, one chain detached."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, perfect. Sorry, I'm lining up my keys and my wallet by the door while we talk, I've got to head out in a minute. You know how it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, we're almost done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I mean, do you need anything else from me? Is somebody going to call me back, like a follow-up call, or is that it? I want to make sure I don't miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You shouldn't need to do anything. If the crew has a question about the location, they might call you at the number we have. Otherwise, it's just a matter of getting it repaired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good, good. That works. Thank you, Beth, you have a good day, all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:48:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Herrera. Thanks for calling."
    }
  ],
